# /settings' Collapse tool calls row: a tool group on the screen, collapse on,
# then a second group, a command approved, running, and stopped with Ctrl-C.
# Both in ask mode, so the command is decided by key (as `toolgroup.cap`).
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
fx: gateway settings-collapse-fx.json
xfx: gateway settings-collapse-xfx.json
work toolgroup-ws
fx: seed toolgroup-ask-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 2
type look
key Enter
wait 3
snap group
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
key Right
wait 0.8
snap collapse-on
home collapse-on
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap after-esc
type again
key Enter
wait 3
snap group2
type run it
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap cmd-ask
key 1
wait 1.5
snap running
key C-c
wait 1.5
snap stopped
wait 4
snap later
